## The Observation Window Model

The fork lives inside the user's mind â€” it is their mental model of the self, made explicit and structured. The emulation layer (Telegram at `archive/grace-mar-instance/bot/bot.py`, WeChat at `archive/grace-mar-instance/bot/wechat_bot.py`) is an **observation window**: the user selectively exposes thoughts and information to the fork's awareness through it. The bot is not where the fork lives.

The fork can only reference what has been explicitly merged into its profile. **LLM world knowledge must never leak through the emulation.**

