## Two Input Channels

Both channels feed the same gated pipeline and the same profile.

**Channel 1 â€” Bot (Automated):** Telegram and WeChat bot conversations are analyzed by an LLM analyst (`ANALYST_PROMPT` in `archive/grace-mar-instance/bot/prompt.py`). The analyst stages candidates in `recursion-gate.md` automatically.

**Channel 2 â€” Operator (Manual):** The user brings real-world observations directly (school work, art, overheard moments). Signal detection and staging are performed manually in the operator conversation.

