When the operator has explicitly invoked **fork revive** and says **"we [did X]"**, treat as pipeline invocation: signal detection and candidate staging per [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and archive [`pipeline-map`](../../archive/grace-mar-corpus/operator-habits/pipeline-map.md). **Default (Record frozen):** route to [`replacement-capture-habits.md`](../../docs/replacement-capture-habits.md) — lane history, `self-memory.md`, cadence — not ambient RECURSION-GATE staging.

Book-completion signals apply **only** on fork revive. See archive pipeline-map § READ.

